WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
With Quickler, you are always in control.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.140
Once we've written the report, you can click any answer to edit it.

3
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.980
All edits save as you go, whether you've changed a word, a sentence or a paragraph.

4
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:15.480
Quickler also learns your habits and the changes you make to make

5
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.040
things easier in the future.
